hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"12","[AI-translation] Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) anasimulia: Mu'awiyah ibn Abi Sufyan (Allah amridhie) aliporudi kutoka Hija akafika Madina, Sa'id ibn al-As akasimama kumpokea. Mu'awiyah (Allah amridhie) akasema: Ndugu yako ana ufahamu wa dini kuliko wewe; nimemsikia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akisema: ((Yule anayependa watu wamsimamie anapokuja, Mwenyezi Mungu atamjengea nyumba Motoni))."
